  "content": "[Intro]\n[Bb]\n[F]\n[Gm]\n[F]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bb]Why does the\nsun go on\n[F]shining?\n[Gm]Why does the\nsea rush to\n[Dm]shore?\n[Eb]Don’t they\n[Cm]know it's The\n[Dm]End of the\n[G7]World Cause\n[Cm]you don’t\nlove me any\n[Eb]more\n[F7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bb]Why do the\nbirds go on\n[F]singing?\n[Gm]Why do the\nstars glow a-\n[Dm]bove?\n[Eb]Don't they\n[Cm]know it's The\n[Dm]End of the\n[G7]World It\n[Cm]ended when I\n[F7]lost your\n[Bb]love\nI\n\n[Chorus]\n[Eb]wake up in the\nmorning and I\n[Bb]wonder\nWhy\n[F]everything's the\nsame as it\n[Bb]was\nI\n[Dm]can't under-\nstand, no, I\n[G7]can't under-\nstand How\n[Cm]life goes\non the way it\n[Eb]does\n[F]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Bb]Why does my\nheart go on\n[F]beating\n[Gm]Why do these\neyes of mine\n[Dm]cry\n[Eb]Don't they\n[Cm]know it's the\n[Dm]end of the\n[G7]world It\n[Cm]ended when you\n[F]said good-\n[Bb]bye\n[Gb]\n\n[Verse 4]\n[B]Why does my\nheart go on\n[Gb]beating\n[Abm]Why do these\neyes of mine\n[Ebm]cry\n[E]Don't they\n[Dbm]know it's the\n[Ebm]end of the\n[Ab7]world It\n[Dbm]ended when you said\n[Gb7]good-\n\n[Outro]\n[B]bye\n[Ebm]\n[E]\n[Gb7]\n[B]",
